53
00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:17.330
And so for 24 hours

54
00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:20.700
I was really sad that my idea was terrible idea.

55
00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:23.030
And then I thought to myself, wait a second,

56
00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:26.670
I've only been in this business for 20 minutes, 24 hours,

57
00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:28.710
