65
00:02:44.572 --> 00:02:48.159
(audience applauds)

66
00:02:48.159 --> 00:02:52.826
So you have helped more than 2 million kids last year.

67
00:02:56.130 --> 00:03:00.730
And what now is your goal?

68
00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:02.470
The need in the world has doubled.

69
00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:05.800
So what I need to do now is double the size of our factory.

70
00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.500
