73
00:03:11.820 --> 00:03:13.010
I brought one with me.

74
00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:15.990
So we make a 1,000 005 of these every single day,

75
00:03:15.990 --> 00:03:19.070
we work 24 hours a day making the product,

76
00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:20.003
called Plumpy'Nut.

77
00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:23.580
I have 110 people who are on my team.

78
00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:27.050
We work 24 hours a day to be able to deliver these products

79
00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:28.549
