80
00:03:28.549 --> 00:03:31.549
(audience applauds)

81
00:03:35.737 --> 00:03:39.180 line:15%
Did you put money from your own pocket into this endeavor?

82
00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:43.770 line:15%
Yes, yes, but we also, you know, I take loans from banks.

83
00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:46.430
I make partnerships, we raise money,

84
00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:49.020
