89
00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:05.300
that through working with them, we've actually yep,

90
00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:08.445
here comes the big check, we've raised $25,000.

91
00:04:08.445 --> 00:04:11.745
(audience applauds)

92
00:04:11.745 --> 00:04:12.578
Wow.

93
00:04:15.197 --> 00:04:16.947
Courtesy of Perdue.

94
